SUMMARY:The Bride!
DTSTART:20260308T194500Z
DTEND:20260308T222000Z
DTSTAMP:20260308T194500Z
UID:vksSIfyOqL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 136 mins (2h16m)\n\nIn 1930s Chicago\, groundbreakin
 g scientist Dr. Euphronious brings a murdered young woman back to life to 
 be a companion for Frankenstein's monster. What happens next is beyond wha
 t either of them could ever have imagined.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/
 in-theaters/the-bride\n\nEstimated start: 13:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
