BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Days and Nights in the Forest (1970)
DTSTART:20260308T201500Z
DTEND:20260308T224000Z
DTSTAMP:20260308T201500Z
UID:wu2vLWdWVP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 126 mins (2h06m)\n\nIn this newly restored cult favo
 rite by Indian legend Satyajit Ray\, four young male urbanites decamp to t
 he countryside for some rest and relaxation\, only to have their pride and
  prejudices challenged by three women. New 4K Restoration\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/days-and-nights-in-the-forest\n\nEstimated sta
 rt: 13:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
