UID:nkvxlDMMbx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma Mediocre comedian (Robert De Niro) dreams of being on the Comedy King
 ’s (Jerry Lewis) TV show. Maybe his chances would improve if he and his 
 friend (Sandra Bernhard) kidnapped his idol. Delightfully cringey.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/martin-scorsese/the-king-of-comedy\n\
 nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
