BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Post Alley Film Festival
DTSTART:20260321T180000Z
DTEND:20260322T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20260321T180000Z
UID:86ZtSkIpXx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 448 mins (7h28m)\n\nPresented by Women in Film Seatt
 le A day of woman-centric & eccentric short films from around the block an
 d around the world. Twenty-five creatively diverse short film stories in 6
  thematic groups: Oh Mother\, Fantasy\, Family Matters\, Choices\, Docs Ro
 ck\, and A Lighter Side.  There’s a break for lunch\, stretch time\, Q&A
 ’s\, a reception after the screenings\, a silent auction and raffle duri
 ng the fest. Your ticket helps secure the future of Post Alley Film Festiv
 al and provide a venue for women’s filmwork.  SCHEDULE10:30am - Doors 
 open11:00am - Seating & welcome by Virginia Bogert\, PAFF Founder/Directo
